<Page current="about" title="About — It's Not Easy Being Bjorn"><div class="inner">

<p>
    Meet Bjorn. He's a decent fellow. A little scruffy,
    perpetually weary, and rather good at fixing things.
  </p>

  <p>
    He likes to help, has a knack for spotting trouble,
    and generally tries to do right by the people
    around him.
  </p>

  <p>
    Bjorn is resourceful, thoughtful, and remarkably
    persistent. He believes in doing what's right,
    even when it isn't particularly popular.
  </p>

  <p>
    <em>It's Not Easy Being Bjorn</em> is a comic about
    human nature, the absurdities of everyday life,
    and the perpetual difficulty of doing the right thing.
  </p>

  <p>
    Bjorn wouldn't have it any other way.
  </p>

<p>
  The concepts and scripts are my own work. The images are generated
  with ChatGPT because I’m not a very good artist. Bjorn deserves
  better than my stick figures; he’s dealing with enough already.
</p>
</div>
</Page>
